OL,3,GNEWSAOther Voices festival's return to
OL,4,ADerry 'a dream come true'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe founder and director of an
OL,7,Finternationally-acclaimed music
OL,8,Ffestival has said its return to
OL,9,FLondonderry is "a dream come true" and
OL,10,Fwill help make the city "visible and
OL,11,Faudible" on the global music stage.
OL,13,FOther Voices, which is marking its 25th
OL,14,Fanniversary this year, is a two-day
OL,15,Fcelebration of music, art and culture,
OL,16,Fwith performances streamed globally
OL,17,Fonline.
OL,19,FAbout 24,000 people are expected to
OL,20,Fattend events in person, generating an
OL,21,Festimated #1.5m for the local economy.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
