OL,3,GNEWSAOther Voices festival's return to
OL,4,ADerry 'a dream come true'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis year's Other Voices line-up
OL,7,Fincludes a mix of established artists
OL,8,Fand also emerging talent, with a strong
OL,9,Ffocus on musicians from the north west.
OL,10,FBRIT Award-winner Kate Nash is among
OL,11,Fthe headline acts.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
